    {
     "title": "Jelly Brawl Launches on Xbox November 23rd",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Today I'm launching what I call the day 0 update which contains the majority of changes featured in the upcoming Xbox release which has just gone gold (is fully ready for release) and will be available for pre-order starting November 9th. I'll be releasing another update just prior to release featuring the last few changes and any fixes that are needed after this update.",
